Rules of Civil Procedure (Dec. 1, 2025, uscourts.gov official pamphlet)","target_page":"15","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Rule 8","status":"verified","target_quote":"A pleading that states a claim for relief must contain: ... (2) a short and plain statement of the claim showing that the pleader is entitled to relief;","line":18,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-072-3-1-1-352e65d0","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":34,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-072","src_page":"3","text":"ECF No. 70","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-070","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 70","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":19,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-072-3-1-1-777e72d0","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-072","src_page":"3","text":"ECF No. 70-1","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-070-01","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 70-1","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":20,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-072-3-1-1-e165e333","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-072","src_page":"3","text":"Rules 12(b)(1), 12(b)(2), and 12(b)(6)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Federal Rules of Civil Procedure (Dec. 1, 2025, uscourts.gov official pamphlet)","target_page":"20","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Rule 12(b)(1)","status":"verified","target_quote":"But a party may assert the following defenses by motion: ... (1) lack of subject-matter jurisdiction;","line":21,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-072-3-1-1-9c05fd6b","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":39,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":